Output "OUT_DIR/ask.gif"
Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 20
Set Width 1200
Set Height 560
Set Padding 28
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 45ms
Hide
Type "source DEMO_DIR/zshrc && clear" Enter
Sleep 1s
Show
Sleep 600ms
Type "? find files bigger than 100MB here"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Wait+Screen@90s /Y\/n/
Sleep 2.5s
Type "y"
Sleep 3s
